      ],
      "image": "assets/images/25241/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat 2 inches oil in a deep saucepan over medium heat to 365 degrees F (185 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "While oil is heating, mix together onion, sugar, and eggs in a medium bowl. Blend in flour and cornmeal to make a batter.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/SkEgXV7h1aaw8RqhskP98RjMN0s=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/25241-vickis-hush-puppies-ddmfs-step-2-0164-090b16eb4cfe4ea7b138b310dc846d3d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/25241/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Drop batter by rounded teaspoonfuls, 4 at a time, into hot oil and fry until golden brown, 1 to 2 minutes per side. Transfer to a paper towel-lined plate to drain.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
